WEBVTT

00:08:30.204 --> 00:08:35.010
When time horizons are long and nebulous,
as they typically are in youth,

00:08:35.034 --> 00:08:36.976
people are constantly preparing,

00:08:37.000 --> 00:08:40.755
trying to soak up all the information
they possibly can,

00:08:40.779 --> 00:08:43.025
taking risks, exploring.

00:08:43.049 --> 00:08:45.992
We might spend time with people
we don't even like

00:08:46.016 --> 00:08:48.115
because it's somehow interesting.

00:08:48.139 --> 00:08:50.335
We might learn something unexpected.

00:08:50.359 --> 00:08:52.419
(Laughter)

00:08:52.443 --> 00:08:53.976
We go on blind dates.

00:08:54.000 --> 00:08:57.253
(Laughter)

00:08:57.277 --> 00:08:58.447
You know, after all,

00:08:58.471 --> 00:09:00.976
if it doesn't work out,
there's always tomorrow.